{"name":"Tilted Pinball","hex":"#ee5522","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"tilted","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of tilt"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a vehicle, fitted with a tilt (canvas covering).","In a state of frustration and worsened performance resulting from a series of losses."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tilted"},{"term":"pinball","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A game, played on a device with a sloping base (a pinball machine), in which the player operates a spring-loaded plunger to shoot a ball, between obstacles, and attempts to hit targets and score points.","The ball used in pinball."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To dart about rapidly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pinball"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pinball","blocks":[{"text":"Pinball games are a family of games in which a ball is propelled into a specially designed table where it bounces off various obstacles, scoring points either en-route or when it comes to rest. Historically the board was studded with nails called 'pins' and had hollows or pockets which scored points if the ball came to rest in them. Today, pinball is most commonly an arcade game in which the ball is fired into a specially designed cabinet known as a pinball machine, hitting various lights, bumpers, ramps, and other targets depending on its design."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/A_rebuilt_Terminator_2_pinball_machine_by_Wayne_Patrick_Finn_Melbourne_Australia._38.jpg/330px-A_rebuilt_Terminator_2_pinball_machine_by_Wayne_Patrick_Finn_Melbourne_Australia._38.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinball"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Niger%2C_Filingu%C3%A9_%2844%29%2C_local_pinball_game.jpg/500px-Niger%2C_Filingu%C3%A9_%2844%29%2C_local_pinball_game.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Niger%2C_Filingu%C3%A9_%2844%29%2C_local_pinball_game.jpg/1280px-Niger%2C_Filingu%C3%A9_%2844%29%2C_local_pinball_game.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Niger%2C_Filingu%C3%A9_%2844%29%2C_local_pinball_game.jpg/500px-Niger%2C_Filingu%C3%A9_%2844%29%2C_local_pinball_game.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":" Boys with a local pinball game in Filingué, Niger","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANiger%2C_Filingu%C3%A9_(44)%2C_local_pinball_game.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Pinball_-_Flipperspel_-_In_Malm%C3%B6_1989.jpg/500px-Pinball_-_Flipperspel_-_In_Malm%C3%B6_1989.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Pinball_-_Flipperspel_-_In_Malm%C3%B6_1989.jpg/1280px-Pinball_-_Flipperspel_-_In_Malm%C3%B6_1989.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Pinball_-_Flipperspel_-_In_Malm%C3%B6_1989.jpg/500px-Pinball_-_Flipperspel_-_In_Malm%C3%B6_1989.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Pinball is played by all ages. Pinball hall in Malmö 1989.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APinball_-_Flipperspel_-_In_Malm%C3%B6_1989.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Early_Pinball.jpg/500px-Early_Pinball.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Early_Pinball.jpg/1280px-Early_Pinball.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"ht